1
00:00:00,159 --> 00:00:02,359
(Sheldon:)He's trying to video chat.

2
00:00:06,232 --> 00:00:09,832
(Sheldon:)Perhaps I shouldn't have
taken this into the real world.

3
00:00:09,835 --> 00:00:11,765
Oh, really?

4
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,570
PENNY: "'Time travel?
I don't understand,'

5
00:00:16,575 --> 00:00:18,675
"said Amelia.
Cooper stared at her.

6
00:00:18,677 --> 00:00:22,677
'Which word don't you
understand, time or travel?'"

7
00:00:22,681 --> 00:00:26,321
(Bernadette:)Wow, even in your fantasies
Sheldon's kind of exhausting.

8
00:00:27,486 --> 00:00:29,586
(Amy:)He's like that
in the beginning,

9
00:00:29,588 --> 00:00:31,088
(Amy:)so she can change him.

10
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:32,420
(Amy:)It's called good writing.

11
00:00:33,492 --> 00:00:35,592
(Amy:)And wishful thinking.

12
00:00:35,594 --> 00:00:37,224
"It stung Amelia

13
00:00:37,229 --> 00:00:39,159
"when he spoke to her this way.

14
00:00:39,164 --> 00:00:40,364
"In her little
one-room schoolhouse,

15
00:00:40,366 --> 00:00:42,396
"she was always
the smartest student,

16
00:00:42,401 --> 00:00:44,001
"regularly besting the boys
in her class,

17
00:00:44,003 --> 00:00:46,203
"but this was no boy
in front of her--

18
00:00:46,205 --> 00:00:47,235
"this was a man.

19
00:00:47,239 --> 00:00:49,369
(Bernadette:)Here we go.

20
00:00:49,375 --> 00:00:50,875
"Cooper told Amelia

21
00:00:50,876 --> 00:00:52,406
"about all the strange
and incredible things

22
00:00:52,411 --> 00:00:54,011
"the future would hold,
like computers

23
00:00:54,013 --> 00:00:55,513
"and living past 30.

24
00:00:55,514 --> 00:00:57,584
"He asked her
if she had any questions.

25
00:00:57,583 --> 00:00:59,383
"All she longed to ask was

26
00:00:59,385 --> 00:01:01,455
"if his heart was beating
as fast as hers,

